+    /// state blocks 76548f0bf1 and stephenjayakar's StateDelta #641/#717): read once.
+    [[nodiscard]] static bool StateBlocksSwitch();
+    /// EDEN_UP_L1585_STATE_BLOCKS: a Maxwell3D state register write (not in execution_mask) from
+    /// the front, shadow RAM applied (not in replay) and sent because it changes the front's copy
+    /// (or its shadow entry). Writes in a row go to the back as one State entry, closed before any
+    /// other entry, publish or wait (as the Regs entry); the back stores them and sets their
+    /// dirty flags at once (Maxwell3D::WriteStateRegisters). `flags`: the dirty flags the register
